  {
   "id": "s0",
   "title": "Choose a row",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Expand along row 1 (we start with the}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{first row).}\\\\[5pt]&|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}2 + i&1&i\\\\0&2&1\\\\- 3 i&1&6\\end{vmatrix}\\\\[5pt]&|A|=a_{11}A_{11} + a_{12}A_{12} + a_{13}A_{13}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
